   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good so far.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I have a glass of wine to fall asleep, but I always wake up at three. Connected?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Very likely. Alcohol makes you drowsy at first, but as it wears off it disrupts your sleep in the second half of the night.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh. That's annoying, the wine's",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.9,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "the nice part of my evening.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.25,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Understandable. Having it earlier, with dinner rather than right before bed, gives your body time to process it.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How much earlier?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ideally a few hours before sleep. You could also try a herbal tea as the new bedtime ritual a few nights a week and compare.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'll try it for a week and see.",
